WEBVTT

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:08.440
Crane! Crane!

00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:17.700
Craneane...

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:23.790
She's just using the damage done to the 
Flower of your Heart for her own agenda!

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:26.330
Please, remember who you used to be!

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:32.880
Huh? I-It stopped again?

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:34.590
This is just another repeat...

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:36.090
Now's your chance!

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:40.330
Fortissimo!

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.100
...of the same old losing setup!

00:00:58.510 --> 00:00:59.420
Hm?

00:01:01.650 --> 00:01:05.190
Have flowers always been this beautiful?

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:05.980
{OP}

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:09.170
HeartCatch

00:01:09.170 --> 00:01:10.630
Precure!

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:14.210
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:17.180
Now, all together

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:19.670
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:19.850 --> 00:01:22.690
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:30.310
Within each of our chests,

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:32.980
they begin to sprout

00:01:33.190 --> 00:01:34.640
The seeds of the heart

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:35.900
are growing

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:38.530
bit by bit

00:01:38.620 --> 00:01:39.210
Red,

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:39.820
white

00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:41.130
and yellow

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:43.870
It's because these blooming buds are

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:45.330
all varied colors

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:46.800
that they

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:48.960
shine so brightly!

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:54.300
That smile that you've nurtured

00:01:55.130 --> 00:01:56.800
with such care

00:01:56.920 --> 00:01:59.510
will never wither

00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:03.100
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:05.970
Now, all together

00:02:05.970 --> 00:02:08.450
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:11.100
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:16.040
They're always right by our sides

00:02:16.040 --> 00:02:16.870
So together

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:20.670
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:23.670
bloom even more!

00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:25.120
HeartCatch

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:26.660
Precure!

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:35.170
Hm?

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:39.870
Yuri?

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:48.140
The Saddening Truth<i>!</i>

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:48.140
The Saddening Truth<i>!</i>

00:02:50.790 --> 00:02:53.610
The red spider lilies have bloomed rather beautifully, haven't they?

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:01.000
They're so beautiful!

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:02.280
I suppose so.

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:03.870
Tsubomi!

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:08.000
It's Yuri!

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:25.640
Yuri seems kinda sad, doesn't she?

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:27.170
Yeah...

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:29.560
Fashion Club

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:29.560
Fashion Club

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:29.560
Now recruiting!

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:29.560
We'll be waiting!

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:29.560
My friends!

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:33.230
The school's fall festival draws close!

00:03:33.660 --> 00:03:36.730
Precious little time remains to us!

00:03:37.120 --> 00:03:38.830
Enough with the theatrics, Erika.

00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:40.980
We've still got more than a month left!

00:03:40.980 --> 00:03:42.360
How naïve of you!

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:47.860
We can't just panic at the last minute like with our summer homework!

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:48.910
But anyway...

00:03:49.670 --> 00:03:54.200
I want to make sure our fashion show at the fall festival is a huge success!

00:03:55.120 --> 00:03:57.960
We feel the same way too, of course.

00:03:57.960 --> 00:04:02.130
That's why we got the designs for our 
costumes done during our summer camp.

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:03.930
And as for making them...

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:06.160
We finished that too!

00:04:06.160 --> 00:04:07.430
Yay!

00:04:07.920 --> 00:04:11.590
So, you see, I know we're about to 
start rehearsing for the fashion show, 

00:04:11.590 --> 00:04:15.150
but I thought it'd be kinda neat if we had something special to draw people in to see the show!

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:18.060
Well, we're doing all the modeling ourselves, after all.

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:20.580
We're pretty much as boring as it gets, huh?

00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:21.660
Oh, I know!

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:24.610
Why not ask Momoka to come as a special guest!

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:25.770
Huh?

00:04:25.770 --> 00:04:30.460
If a top-selling model like Momoka's at our show, it'll be a surefire hit!

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:32.040
Yeah!

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:35.110
I don't wanna have to ask her, but guess I can try. {Added the initial I}

00:04:35.110 --> 00:04:36.440
Um...

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:40.300
I'd like to ask Yuri to come model as well!

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:41.210
Ask Yuri?

00:04:41.570 --> 00:04:44.120
Hey, who's this Yuri?

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:47.460
She's a friend of Momo's, and she's really pretty!

00:04:47.460 --> 00:04:48.740
Really?

00:04:50.080 --> 00:04:51.600
I think that's a good idea too!

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:53.810
It's settled, then!

00:04:54.410 --> 00:04:56.480
Here you go. History and Classics.

00:04:57.020 --> 00:04:58.790
Thanks as always!

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:01.950
It's gotta be a hard life, being a model.

00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:06.200
Nah, I get by since you're here to help me.

00:05:07.360 --> 00:05:10.320
While I'm singing your praises, can I ask you a favor?

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:14.330
I really don't get some of this stuff in our math class.

00:05:14.770 --> 00:05:15.500
All right.

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:16.460
Yay!

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:19.790
There's really nothing more
 important than friends, huh? {There really is -> There's really, and added 'more'}

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:22.640
And having a cute little sister.

00:05:22.640 --> 00:05:24.500
What's going on, Erika?

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:27.860
I wanna ask you a favor, Momo!

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:29.260
And you as well, Yuri!

00:05:29.560 --> 00:05:30.680
Me too?

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:31.890
That's right!

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:34.680
I have business with Tsukikage Yuri as well, I'm afraid.

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:39.520
Who are you?

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:46.030
Because Tsukikage keeps getting the best test scores, he is disgracefully labeled "That guy in second!"

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:48.790
He is none other than Saitani Hideo!

00:05:48.790 --> 00:05:50.030
Y-You guys!

00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:51.990
Oh, from Class 1.

00:05:52.280 --> 00:05:55.260
But now, I'm going to cast away that nickname!

00:05:55.260 --> 00:05:59.110
For I shall take first place in the next test, I swear it!

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:04.170
I hope you're looking forward to it, Tsukikage Yuri!

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:08.780
Lovely.{She's just using a sentence modifier that's basically the Japanese equivalent of "...he said." I guess 'So he says' or something would be more literal but she's not really questioning or denying, just a kind of "well that came out of nowhere" type thing.}

00:06:10.320 --> 00:06:12.860
By the way, what was this favor you wanted to ask?

00:06:12.860 --> 00:06:14.680
Oh, well the thing is...

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:17.390
You want us to model for you?

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:21.310
I'd really like to design a dress for you to wear, Yuri!

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:25.260
Oh? What kind of dress?

00:06:25.260 --> 00:06:27.630
The theme is...

00:06:28.460 --> 00:06:30.240
"a new me"!

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:33.430
Seems fun!

00:06:33.430 --> 00:06:35.060
How about we give it a go, Yuri?

00:06:35.060 --> 00:06:37.310
Sorry, but I can't.

00:06:37.310 --> 00:06:38.120
Huh?

00:06:38.720 --> 00:06:41.830
Momoka, I'll help you with that math some other time, okay?

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:42.710
Yuri!

00:07:10.310 --> 00:07:11.280
Sabark.

00:07:12.210 --> 00:07:15.200
How long do you intend to let
 these Precure run wild, may I ask?{lit: "how long are you going to assume the problem will take care of itself"} {Can we change this to "How long do you intend to let these Precures run wild, may I ask?" It might not be the closest literal translation, but it's a nice reference to how we translate the lieutenants' egging the Desertrians on.}

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:18.290
I ask but for a little more patience, King Dune.

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:20.500
How unexpectedly lax of you.

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:21.900
Unless, of course, you...

00:07:21.900 --> 00:07:23.960
I already have a plan in motion.

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:25.840
Oh?

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:28.180
I don't mind how you choose to do it.

00:07:28.180 --> 00:07:31.800
Just ensure those Precure are eliminated, and the Great Heart Tree perishes.

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:37.240
Sasorina, your constant failure is rather hideous, I must say.

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:41.680
The only reason I keep losing is because my Desertrians don't listen to me anymore!

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:44.540
Your excuses! Are also! Hideous!

00:07:47.790 --> 00:07:50.740
Maybe I should go on a trip or something.

00:07:54.050 --> 00:07:55.950
What's the matter with you?

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:57.510
It couldn't be love, could it?

00:07:57.510 --> 00:08:01.540
But you mustn't fall in love with me, I'm 
afraid, for I am far too beautiful for you.

00:08:06.990 --> 00:08:09.800
I have a present for you all today.

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:12.370
Dark Bracelets.

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:21.270
If you use these, you can make your Desertrians even darker, even viler, and even more ferocious than before!

00:08:28.280 --> 00:08:35.570
Sasorina was bathed in the Precures' holy light, and her heart was partially purified.

00:08:40.380 --> 00:08:43.040
But it seems she has now recovered her dark heart.

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:47.070
Thank you so much, my lord Sabark!

00:08:48.820 --> 00:08:49.590
Take them!

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:53.970
How very beautiful.

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:58.840
Sabark, my liege! Please let me take on those Precure again!

00:08:58.840 --> 00:08:59.930
Very well.

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:02.430
This time, make sure you defeat them!

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:05.380
Just leave it to me!

00:09:10.240 --> 00:09:11.760
Really?

00:09:11.760 --> 00:09:14.070
They asked you to be a model, Yuri?

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:18.320
It seems like it'd be fun, doesn't it? Why not give it a try?

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:21.290
I'm sure if you did, the Flower of your Heart would...

00:09:21.720 --> 00:09:26.120
The Flower of my Heart was 
lost to me when I lost my fairy.

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:31.250
When it happened, my heart was torn apart, and that half of it will never come back.

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:35.560
I suppose the damage to your
 heart still hasn't healed, has it?

00:09:36.620 --> 00:09:42.040
But do you really think your fairy would want to see you in this sorry state?

00:09:43.960 --> 00:09:49.270
I'm sure he'd want the Flower of your Heart to bloom again, Yuri.

00:09:57.960 --> 00:09:59.910
Yuri's fairy...

00:10:01.100 --> 00:10:02.410
died?

00:10:29.590 --> 00:10:31.820
G-Good morning...

00:10:31.820 --> 00:10:34.000
Why'd ya have to make us get up so early?

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:35.170
Oh, come on!

00:10:35.170 --> 00:10:39.180
We agreed to practice our new move at the dojo before school, didn't we?!

00:10:39.180 --> 00:10:39.910
Oh!

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:43.580
School of Myoudouin

00:10:44.140 --> 00:10:45.080
Let's begin.

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:46.750
Ready!

00:10:54.280 --> 00:10:55.880
Spin, spin, spin, spin, spin.

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:57.280
Jump, Tsubomi!

00:10:57.280 --> 00:10:58.060
All right!

00:10:58.060 --> 00:10:59.050
Higher!

00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:00.180
All right!

00:11:01.780 --> 00:11:03.600
Are you all right, Tsubomi?!

00:11:03.940 --> 00:11:06.300
You seem to be a bit distracted today.

00:11:06.300 --> 00:11:07.680
Did something happen?

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:10.230
Well, the thing is...

00:11:11.660 --> 00:11:13.840
Yuri's fairy?

00:11:13.840 --> 00:11:14.610
That's right.

00:11:15.050 --> 00:11:16.480
I see.

00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:18.110
That's why she said...

00:11:19.220 --> 00:11:24.660
You were one step away from losing your partner forever.

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:27.480
She said that to you?

00:11:27.480 --> 00:11:31.260
How did Yuri's fairy pass away, anyway?

00:11:31.260 --> 00:11:34.670
I thought Grandma would know, so I tried asking her.

00:11:35.180 --> 00:11:41.340
She said that Yuri should tell us herself 
once she feels like she can talk about it.

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:43.430
I see.

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:49.930
I tried imagining how I'd feel if we lost Chypre and the others,

00:11:49.930 --> 00:11:53.560
but when I did, I just felt so sad I burst into tears.

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:55.170
I know what you mean.

00:11:57.330 --> 00:11:59.270
What?!

00:11:58.650 --> 00:11:59.820
Tsukikage Yuri

00:11:58.650 --> 00:11:59.820
Saitani Hideo

00:11:58.650 --> 00:11:59.820
m 291 189 l 291 421 l 1282 421 l 1282 188 m 290 429 l 290 706 l 1282 705 l 1283 427 

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:02.530
You did it, Hideo! Your position as #2 is safe for another day!

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:13.420
I was certain I'd beat her this time.

00:12:14.140 --> 00:12:16.550
I don't even feel like trying anymore.

00:12:17.300 --> 00:12:17.960
Who're you?

00:12:18.640 --> 00:12:21.570
The Flower of your Heart is wilting pretty nicely.

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:23.470
Hm? Huh?

00:12:23.980 --> 00:12:25.140
Tsukikage?

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:26.720
Saitani, get out of here!

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:27.430
Huh?

00:12:27.910 --> 00:12:29.860
Look who we have here.

00:12:29.860 --> 00:12:33.940
You're too pathetic for me to waste my time on, so just get lost, okay?

00:12:34.320 --> 00:12:35.900
You little failure.

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:44.360
Flower of the Heart, come forth!

00:12:52.590 --> 00:12:55.800
It's your cue, Desertrian!

00:13:00.160 --> 00:13:02.670
Computer!

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:05.000
Big trouble!

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:06.340
It's Saitani!

00:13:06.630 --> 00:13:08.300
He got turned into a Deshertrian!

00:13:09.340 --> 00:13:09.970
Right!

00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:21.650
Seeds of the Precure, go forth!{no Potpourri}

00:13:24.980 --> 00:13:26.340
Precure!

00:13:26.340 --> 00:13:27.910
Open My Heart!

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:17.540
A lone flower, blooming from the earth!

00:14:20.940 --> 00:14:22.700
Cure Blossom!

00:14:25.320 --> 00:14:28.160
A lone flower, swaying in the sea breeze!

00:14:31.340 --> 00:14:32.750
Cure Marine!

00:14:35.260 --> 00:14:38.430
A lone flower, bathing in the Sun's rays!

00:14:40.750 --> 00:14:42.210
Cure Sunshine!

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:49.180
HeartCatch Precure!

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:52.990
Desertrian! Come get me!

00:14:56.390 --> 00:14:57.190
Yuri!

00:14:57.190 --> 00:14:58.310
Took you long enough.

00:14:58.310 --> 00:15:00.260
Get it as far away from the school as you can!

00:15:00.260 --> 00:15:01.080
Okay!

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:06.130
Sunshine!

00:15:11.940 --> 00:15:12.720
Blossom!

00:15:13.090 --> 00:15:15.680
Blossom Impact!

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:29.680
No matter how hard I try, I can't beat Tsukikage!

00:15:29.680 --> 00:15:30.240
Huh?!

00:15:30.560 --> 00:15:35.640
I'm not gonna bother studying anymore! I'm fed up with it all!

00:15:35.640 --> 00:15:39.080
That's right! If you've lost, you should just give up!

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:42.390
Then you can just run wild to forget about it!

00:15:42.390 --> 00:15:43.540
That's wrong!

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:44.330
What?

00:15:44.680 --> 00:15:51.260
What's important is to have a strong heart, keep on trying, and never give up even if you do lose!{JAPAAAAAAAAAN} {Tweaked it a bit. Old: "What's important is to have a strong heart, that keeps on trying and never gives up even if you do lose!"}

00:15:51.260 --> 00:15:52.220
Com?

00:15:54.290 --> 00:15:59.100
But you just ignored that and used 
Saitani's frustration to make a Desertrian.

00:15:59.660 --> 00:16:03.440
I've had it up to here with this!

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:04.920
Beep boop.

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:08.530
Oh, looks like a chance to try this out!

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:14.470
Sink into the darkness, and let your dark heart control you!

00:16:15.920 --> 00:16:18.180
Dark Bracelet!

00:16:29.040 --> 00:16:30.600
It seems even...

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:32.830
...more ferocious than before!

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:39.060
She's not only stolen his heart, {just -> only}

00:16:39.520 --> 00:16:41.930
but she's directly wilting the Flower too!{"Flower of the Heart" is used in full here, but it feels redundant after the last line}

00:16:44.970 --> 00:16:46.780
Hmm...

00:16:46.780 --> 00:16:48.740
Let's get started!

00:16:48.740 --> 00:16:50.750
Say your prayers!

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:53.850
Sunflower Aegis!

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:02.000
This is the power of the Dark Bracelet!

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:08.130
Time to begin the counterattack!

00:17:17.480 --> 00:17:21.790
I think I'll calculate an attack
 pattern you can't possibly avoid!

00:17:30.140 --> 00:17:31.170
Blossom!

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:35.530
Now I can finally vent all my hatred for you three!

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:38.370
Huh?

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:42.410
Leave this to us!

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:43.900
No!

00:17:43.900 --> 00:17:47.180
If you do that, we'll lose you too!

00:17:47.180 --> 00:17:48.010
You can't...

00:17:48.010 --> 00:17:50.630
Not even you can sway us, Yuri!

00:17:51.120 --> 00:17:53.090
We're going to fight too!

00:17:53.520 --> 00:17:55.300
We'll protect everyone!

00:17:55.650 --> 00:17:58.760
We'll protect the Precure!

00:18:00.260 --> 00:18:03.180
Chypre, don't worry about us!

00:18:03.180 --> 00:18:06.640
Coffret, we won't lose, I promise!

00:18:06.640 --> 00:18:10.310
We'll protect you and everyone else, Potpourri!

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:12.730
Quit your yapping!

00:18:21.880 --> 00:18:24.220
Let's show her the results of our training!

00:18:24.220 --> 00:18:26.460
It's time for us to combine our powers!

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:30.080
Our bonds as Precure won't be beaten by your Dark Bracelet!

00:18:39.870 --> 00:18:42.850
Gather, Floral Power!

00:18:44.450 --> 00:18:46.830
Shiny Tambourine!

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:03.080
Flowers, dance for me!

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:07.830
Precure Gold Forte Burst!

00:19:14.570 --> 00:19:17.750
Gather, Dual Floral Power!

00:19:18.680 --> 00:19:24.510
Precure Floral Power Fortissimo!

00:19:31.880 --> 00:19:36.730
Precure Shining Fortissimo!

00:19:41.260 --> 00:19:43.440
Heart Catch!

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:01.760
What's with this "bonds as Precure" rubbish?!

00:20:02.240 --> 00:20:04.830
I'll beat you next time, you'll see!

